uri "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-part" alias AM-CDM-part version "$Revision:$ Last modified on   $Date:$".

import "http://kdl.ge.com/AM-CDM-system".

Part (note "Physical component in the as-built state.") is a class,
	described by partID (note "Globally unique identifier assigned to a specific part within the data model.") with a single value of type string,
	described by partName (note "Human-readable name that designates the part.") with a single value of type string,
	described by partProcessHistory (note "Record of manufacturing activities associated with the part.") with a single value of type ProcessHistory,
	described by partDesignSpecification (note "Design specification that prescribes the finished part.") with a single value of type DesignSpecification,
	described by partProcessSpecificPartDesign (note "Design files that specifies an intermediate state of a part after completion of a manufacturing process step.") with values of type DesignSpecification,
	described by partProject (note "Project associated with the part.") with values of type Project.

DesignSpecification (note "Document that defines requirements for a part.") is a class,
	described by designSpecID (note "Globally unique identifier assigned to a specific design specification within the data model.") with a single value of type string,
	described by designSpecName (note "Human-readable name that designates the design specification.") with a single value of type string,
	described by designSpecAuthor (note "Person who authors the design specification.") with a single value of type Person,
	described by designSpecCriticality (note "Designation of the consequence associated with failure of the specified part.") with a single value of type string,
	described by designSpecRequirements (note "Document that states requirements or objectives for a component or specimen to be manufactured.") with a single value of type Document,
	described by designSpecDesign (note "Design file that specifies a component.") with values of type Design.

PartSpecificProcessParameters (note "Set of process parameters that apply to a specific part.") is a class,
	described by partSpecOrientation (note "Orientation specified for the part.") with a single value of type Orientation,
	described by partSpecDesign (note "Design file that prescribes process-specific changes to the part.") with a single value of type Design.

Design (note "Document that specifies the geometry and characteristics of a part for manufacture.") is a type of Document,
	described by designSoftware (note "Software used to create or modify the design.") with a single value of type Software,
	described by designRevNumber (note "Identifier that distinguishes a revision of the part design.") with a single value of type string,
	described by designOriginatingOrganization (note "Organization that developed the design file.") with values of type Organization,
	described by designDerivedFromPartDesign (note "Part design from which the design is derived.") with a single value of type Design.

ReverseEngineeredModel (note "Design model created from scan data of a part.") is a type of Design.

PrimarySourceModel (note "Original part design before adaptation for manufacturing.") is a type of Design.

AugmentedSourceModel (note "Part design modified to account for distortion effects during additive manufacturing.") is a type of Design.
